# Real UI → storyboard map (source: handoff ui/recordings/CAPTURE_LOG.md)
D = handoff ui/recordings/agentic-office-demo.mp4 (no audio, 1080p). C = collab-demo-take.mp4.

| Beat | Source | In–out | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| 7 The turn — one request typed | D | 101–120 (1×) | "Take DACH Q4 down to 8.5… make the memo and the deck match… show me" — our hero request. Film-credit type can mirror it. |
| 8 Night shift — work across files | D | 120–140 (8×) | Excel inline bar "changed 1 cell · Revenue!E6 8.9 → 8.5 · Reject/Accept", memo tracked changes, deck. **Keep a "sped up" label.** |
| 8 alt — agent plan | D | 21–33 (7×) | "Reading your files… Locate all FY26 references… Verify". **Never 33–40** (hermes_tools, temp path, failed step). |
| 9 Hero review — the list + diff | D | 41–48 (1×) | "Changes ready for review · 0 of 7", per-file groups, −€71–73m / +€75m. |
| 9 Hero review — accepted | D | 140–147 (1×) | Accept all → "10 of 10 accepted"; memo now €74.6m. |
| 8b Domino / new deck | D | 52–97 | Prompt → Lender Deck opens; Evidence panel 90–97. |
| 9b Not alone | C | 3.4–31 | Live session, Priya + assistant edit 26→28 months, proposal, Accept → €74.6m. **Label: "Demo session · simulated teammate".** |
| Deck polish | clips/deck-scroll.mp4 | all | Lender deck scroll, good punch-in material. |

